        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:maxCardinality 1 ;
            owl:onProperty tvbo:path ] ;
    skos:definition "Location of a recipe's callable code so the specification is decoupled from where the code lives. Either a local directory or a git repository; the resolved directory (optionally a ``subdir`` within it) is placed on the import path at load time so ``module:`` references resolve by bare name. ``path`` and ``git`` are mutually exclusive." ;
