<https://w3id.org/tvbo/ParallelMode#pmap> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "pmap (ParallelMode)" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy tvbo:struct ;
    rdfs:subClassOf tvbo:ParallelMode ;
    skos:definition "Parallel execution across the local devices of a single node (jax.pmap over the several GPUs/TPUs visible to that task). Intra-task only — it never spans nodes; inter-node parallelism is scheduler fan-out (DistributionConfig.chunk), not pmap. On a one-GPU (or CPU) task this degenerates to vmap." ;
    skos:notation "pmap" .

