            owl:onProperty tvbo:gres ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:minCardinality 0 ;
            owl:onProperty tvbo:array_chunk ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:maxCardinality 1 ;
            owl:onProperty tvbo:venv ] ;
    skos:definition "Execution directives for a workflow engine. Every field is optional and each engine's emitter consumes the subset it supports, so one block may carry directives for more than one target. The generic resource fields (cpus_per_task, mem, time) map across engines; the remaining fields are named for the engine that reads them (Slurm: partition/account/gres/ mail_*/array_chunk; Snakemake: cores; Nextflow: executor/queue). Any directive not named here is passed through ``options`` verbatim, so the block stays extensible without a schema change." ;
    skos:exactMatch tvbo:WorkflowEngineConfig ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/tvbo> .

