    rdfs:range xsd:anyURI ;
    skos:definition "External ontology IRIs (typically GO, ChEBI, UBERON, CL, MeSH) that this entity is a surrogate / abstraction / model of. Realized as the `tvbo:surrogate_of` object property, carried inline with the YAML data instance. Multiple IRIs allowed: a single parameter may abstract several biological processes (e.g. a synaptic conductance grounding both GO:0060079 (excitatory PSP) and GO:0007268 (chemical synaptic transmission))." ;
    skos:inScheme <https://w3id.org/tvbo> ;
    skos:notation "grounding" .

