    owl:unionOf ( <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#mean_field> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#neural_mass> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#phase_oscillator> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#phenomenological> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#spiking> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#generic> <https://w3id.org/tvbo/ModelType#field> ) ;
